strong across major sectors, offering opportunities for sustainable growth.","quote":"Credit demand has remained healthy across key sectors, and we continue to see broad-based opportunities for sustainable growth.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBIN_13082026185336_Transcript.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"The bank experienced broad-based growth across retail, agriculture, MSME, and corporate segments due to healthy demand.","quote":"Underpinned by our diversified business model, growth has remained broad-based across retail, agriculture, MSME and corporate segments, reflecting healthy demand.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBIN_13082026185336_Transcript.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"The bank improved its yields by renegotiating T-bill-linked pricing in many instances.","quote":"But largely the T-bill pricing itself is renegotiated in many cases, improving the yield.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBIN_13082026185336_Transcript.pdf","page":15.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"The bank is provisioning for an expected 3,000 crore rupees of performance-linked incentives by spreading it equally across four quarters.","quote":"See, expected PLI is around ₹3000 crore. Instead of taking in the last quarter, we are taking every quarter one-fourth of that.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBIN_13082026185336_Transcript.pdf","page":25.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"The domestic net interest margin remained stable at 3%, giving management confidence in its full-year guidance.","quote":"Operating Profit grew by 9.77% year-on-year, while our domestic Net Interest Margin remained resilient at 3%, reinforcing our confidence in maintaining our guidance for the financial year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBIN_13082026185336_Transcript.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"orders","statement":"The bank's corporate credit pipeline, including undisbursed loans and unutilized working capital, exceeds nine lakh crore rupees.","quote":"Overall, if you include the undisbursed term loans, unutilized working capital and pipeline, it exceeds ₹9 lakh crore.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBIN_13082026185336_Transcript.pdf","page":17.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"debt","statement":"The bank raised one billion dollars through overseas foreign currency bonds and 300 million dollars through external commercial borrowings.","quote":"And we also have done OFCB of $1 billion, and $300 million of ECBs.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBIN_13082026185336_Transcript.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"The bank launched MSME Dream to extend its business rule engine for SME loans up to 10 crore rupees to speed up credit decisions.","quote":"On the credit side, we launched MSME Dream, through which we extended our business rule engine to cover SME loans up to ₹10 crore from the earlier ₹5 crore, enabling faster credit decisions while maintaining underwriting discipline.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBIN_13082026185336_Transcript.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"The bank has started establishing a dedicated collection vertical for the first time.","quote":"So, we have, for the first time, embarked on creating a full-fledged collection vertical.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBIN_13082026185336_Transcript.pdf","page":20.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"The Indian economy remains resilient due to strong domestic demand, healthy investment, robust services, and a well-capitalized banking sector.","quote":"Despite these external challenges, the Indian economy has continued to demonstrate remarkable resilience, supported by strong domestic demand, healthy investment activity, robust services growth and a well-capitalized banking system.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBIN_13082026185336_Transcript.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"risks","statement":"The global environment is characterized by geopolitical uncertainty, changing trade dynamics, and volatility in commodity and financial markets.","quote":"The first quarter has unfolded against a global backdrop marked by geopolitical uncertainty, evolving trade dynamics and continued volatility across commodity and financial markets.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBIN_13082026185336_Transcript.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"tone","statement":"positive","quote":"We believe that the forex fee income has bottomed out in 1Q and we should be able to deliver better in the forthcoming quarters.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBIN_13082026185336_Transcript.pdf","page":26.0,"kind":"extracted"}],"kpis":[{"kpi":"NIM %","value":2.86,"unit":"%","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBIN_07082026135619_Presentation.pdf","page":20},{"kpi":"Advances growth YoY %","value":18.63,"unit":"%","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBIN_07082026135619_Presentation.pdf","page":9},{"kpi":"Deposit growth YoY %","value":9.73,"unit":"%","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBIN_07082026135619_Presentation.pdf","page":9},{"kpi":"CASA ratio %","value":39.24,"unit":"%","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBIN_07082026135619_Presentation.pdf","page":14},{"kpi":"Gross NPA %","value":1.47,"unit":"%","do